e IV).\n- **`crypto_secretstream_..._pull` has no verify-only mode** — `m` is `nonnull` and unconditionally written, unlike every AEAD `*_decrypt_detached` and secretbox `*_open_detached`, which accept `m == NULL`.\n- **`_push` performs no tag validation**: any byte 0x00-0xFF is accepted and encrypted verbatim; only bit `0x02` (REKEY) is interpreted. Counter wrap after 2^32-1 messages triggers an implicit rekey, not an error.\n- No `sodium_is_zero` weak-key check exists in G4 (that lives in crypto_box/crypto_kx), and there are **no runtime NULL checks anywhere** — `__attribute__((nonnull))` is compile-time only."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":201,"cache_read_input_tokens":153166,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":201,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_018FGTxdrHpWRi3y21xP9nBY","session_id":"37babf23-64fa-4bd5-8c90-ef1a4034e89f","uuid":"47adee2b-7d01-45de-9c7c-a0d0c50c8647","timestamp":"2026-09-08T15:13:13.275Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Enumerate aead/secretbox/stream error/config"}
